# Content snapshot media. Committed directly (not Git LFS): total ~60MB but every
# file is small (largest ~2MB, far under GitHub's 100MB/file limit), and LFS would
# add a required tool + bandwidth quota that works against the one-command clone
# goal in DEPLOY.md. Marked binary so Git never tries to diff or normalise them.
data/media/** binary

# The exported snapshot is text; keep it LF so it applies cleanly on any OS.
data/snapshot.sql text eol=lf
